{"channelId":"UCDA89RpR0-SwuW87UFhvIRQ","row":["The Animal Rescue League of Boston",5220,"Pets are family. This belief is at the heart of everything we do at the Animal Rescue League of Boston.\n\nWe are the first female-founded animal welfare organization in Massachusetts and are proud to carry on a legacy of kindness and compassion, helping more than 20,000 animals annually since 1899.\n\nRecognized for our innovative, award-winning programs that go beyond sheltering, we address the root causes of the issues facing animals and the people who love them.\n\nBy partnering with communities, we help animals heal and thrive, keep pets and people together, and protect animals from harm.\n\nBecause there is no government funding for this important work, animals must rely on people like you to get the care they need, when they need it most, 365 days a year.\n\nSign up for ARL’s e-newsletter for the most current animal stories, advocacy and program updates, events, and more at https://arl.boston/e-news-sign-up","info@arlboston.org; boston-adoption@arlboston.org; brewster-adoption@arlboston.org; bvc@arlboston.org; dedham-adoption@arlboston.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDA89RpR0-SwuW87UFhvIRQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDA89RpR0-SwuW87UFhvIRQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:29.057Z","channelId":"UCDA89RpR0-SwuW87UFhvIRQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7e1a113e6850465a114dd0386c9efb81313c4fdcedb3a5a03593eaa445929961","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"9d8e99967e99d33ced048c1a60e629b9c5a08792ae56a965c386a82207b6385d"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDA89RpR0-SwuW87UFhvIRQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:29.057Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDA89RpR0-SwuW87UFhvIRQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":5220,"raw":"5.22K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube